# Agent-rules files written automatically by `next dev`
# (node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js re-adds them on every
# run). Ignored rather than committed: the root CLAUDE.md is authored project
# truth, whereas `apps/*/CLAUDE.md` is a one-line `@AGENTS.md` import that would
# make a generated block into directory-scoped project instructions nobody wrote.
# Founder decision 2026-09-16, register 5.197. The root CLAUDE.md stays TRACKED.
apps/*/AGENTS.md
apps/*/CLAUDE.md

# Failed review-gate battery logs on a checkout without private docs (scripts/review-gate.mjs, 5.696)
.review-gate-runs/

# Private material that must never enter this public repository (5.707): a nested checkout
